Changelog
=========

**About historical wording:** This changelog includes entries inherited from
older dupeGuru releases. In those entries, "crash" often meant a handled
exception that showed an error window, while "hard crash" meant that the
application terminated. References to Hardcoded Software reporting services
describe retired upstream behavior and are not current support instructions.
Use the canonical dupeGuru Neo repository and its ``SECURITY.md`` policy for
current reports.

{changelog}
